##"A few people in the field of genetics are using dot to draw "marriage node diagram"  pedigree drawings.  Here is one I have done of a test pedigree from
 the FTREE pedigree drawing package (Lion Share was a racehorse)." Contributed by David Duffy.

##Command to get the layout: "dot -Tpng thisfile > thisfile.png"

